        {
          "text": "kuko Hamani umwansi w’Abayuda bose, mwene Hamedata Umwagagi, yari yagabiye kugeseza Abayuda, kandi yari yapfinze Puri, ari bgo bupfindo, ngw abayigize, abahonnye; ",
