              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi barundura yukw iyo misi ikwiye kwama yibukwa no kugirwa mikuru ukw ibihe vy’urunganwe rwabo bizogenda bikurikirana, mu muryango wose no mu gihugu cose no mu gisagara cose, kandi ngw iyo misi ya Purimu ntize ishingūke mu Bayuda, cank’ icibutso cayo ngo kize kizimangane mu ruvyaro rwabo.",
          "type": "text",
