        {
          "text": "Nukw Abayuda bose bo mu bihugu ijana na mirongwibiri n’indwi, ari vyo bihugu vya Ahasuwerusi, barungikirwa ivyo vyete, birimw’ amajambo y’amahoro n’ay’ ukuri, ",
